# Shortens a full class path to the compact 'libname.classname' notation, which Omnis also
# accepts and which is shorter/more readable.
#   $root.$libs.ZIDETOOLS.$classes.ToolModifyClass  →  ZIDETOOLS.ToolModifyClass
#   $root.$libs.ZIDETOOLS.$codes.Executor        →  ZIDETOOLS.Executor
# pPath → the full path (may already be short; then returned unchanged)
# NOTE: the class-group names must be hard-coded — Omnis offers no runtime list of them.

Calculate path as replace(pPath,'$root.$libs.','') ## strip the leading $root.$libs.

# collapse the class-group segment (.$classes. / .$codes. / .$windows. …) to a single dot
Calculate groupList as split('$classes,$codes,$fieldstyles,$files,$menus,$objects,$prefs,$queries,$remoteforms,$remotemenus,$remoteobjects,$remotetasks,$reports,$schemas,$searches,$tables,$tasks,$toolbars,$windows')
For loop from 1 to groupList.$linecount step 1
	Calculate path as replace(path,con('.',groupList.[loop].C1,'.'),'.')
End For

Quit method path